    "updated_at": "2020-03-23T12:04:20Z",
    "body": "This looks like correct behavior to me. toDataURL returns the size of the backing buffer (canvas.width, canvas.height). devicePixelRatio is mostly irrelevant to toDataURL. There's no upscale/downscale happening anywhere.\r\n\r\nThe paragraph you quote is indeed slightly weird, as it's referring the file format's explicit resolution (like SVG), while talking about the bitmap data. We should amend that.\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
